cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the unpublished manuscript using the preferred citation."
title: "A positive constant-recursive sequence with nonquasipolynomial power ranks"
authors:
  - family-names: Goyal
    given-names: Dev D.
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  An explicit positive integer-valued constant-recursive sequence of rank 13
  has an exact minimal characteristic polynomial for every positive termwise
  power. Its power ranks are a cubic polynomial minus twice a parity-restricted
  square count and are not eventually quasipolynomial. A companion family gives
  infinitely many power-rank sequences at each fixed initial rank at least three.
  Historical priority remains provisional. The main and companion theorems have Lean formalizations; the companion generating function and polynomial corollaries retain conventional proofs.
